spec: okay-chat specs/intent-dsl.md — the terms its thirteen quoted rules wait on

why: okay-chat's Catalog quotes 13 whole rules and a dozen fragments for
  shapes the builder cannot say: a set of letters («мо[юяи]»), a word
  repeated any number of times («(?:мо[юяи]\s+)*»), a stem that may not
  run on («мо\w{1,3}»), an ending of more than one letter («удали(?:ть)?»).
  Each is a shape, not a gap; none is a loophole.

what: Term.Letters, Term.ManyThen, Term.StemUpTo, Term.Endings in Dsl.scala,
  rendered and tested in TestDsl; no existing rendering changes.

